      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رزّح</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرْزِيحٌ</span>, (S, K,) <i>He made</i> a she-camel <i>to fall down by reason of fatigue, emaciated:</i> (S:) or <i>he emaciated</i> her. (K.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَزَّحَتْهَا الأَسْفَارُ</span> <i>Journeys emaciated her.</i> (A, * TA.)

